{#
| Variable                  | Type   | Description                                    |
|---------------------------|--------|------------------------------------------------|
| component                 | object | merchant settings from twilight.json           |
| component.image           | string | the banner — fills the whole card              |
| component.alt             | string | image description for SEO / screen readers     |
| component.show_cta        | bool   | overlay a button on the image                  |
| component.button_text     | string | CTA label                                      |
| component.button_url      | string | CTA link                                       |
| component.pos_x           | int    | button spot, % from the RIGHT edge (0–100)     |
| component.pos_y           | int    | button spot, % from the TOP edge (0–100)       |
| position                  | int    | sorting block                                  |

Same card footprint as qissa-video-banner (uncapped container, 50px gutters,
30px radius) but the uploaded image IS the banner — no text column, no panel
background. The only optional chrome is one CTA, placed freely by percentage.

── The placement trick ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
`right: X%` alone would push the button outside the card as X grows (its own
width isn't accounted for). Pairing it with `translate(X%, …)` — a shift of
X% of the button's OWN size in the opposite sense — makes the scale absolute:
0 = flush right, 50 = dead centre, 100 = flush left, whatever size the button
is. Same for Y vertically. The overlay uses inset (not padding) so "flush"
still keeps the card's breathing room: absolute % offsets resolve against the
containing block's edges and would ignore padding entirely.

Physical right/top on purpose — postcss downlevels logical properties assuming
LTR, and the merchant-facing scale is "٪ من اليمين" regardless of direction.
#}
{% if component.image %}
    {% set x = component.pos_x|default(50) %}
    {% set y = component.pos_y|default(80) %}
    {% set x = x > 100 ? 100 : (x < 0 ? 0 : x) %}
    {% set y = y > 100 ? 100 : (y < 0 ? 0 : y) %}

    <section class="s-block qibanner" id="qibanner-{{ position }}">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="qibanner__box">
                <img class="qibanner__img"
                     src="{{ component.image }}"
                     alt="{{ component.alt|default(component.button_text)|default('') }}"
                     loading="lazy"/>

                {% if component.show_cta and component.button_text and component.button_url %}
                    <div class="qibanner__overlay">
                        <a class="qibanner__btn"
                           href="{{ component.button_url }}"
                           style="right: {{ x }}%; top: {{ y }}%; transform: translate({{ x }}%, -{{ y }}%);">{{ component.button_text }}</a>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endif %}
